      "raw": "<p>You evoke buzzing and crawling insects to climb onto a foe's body and bite, dealing 1d4 piercing damage and potentially sickening the foe, depending on its Fortitude save. Once this spell ends, the target becomes temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} by the crawling insects. The sickened value can't be reduced below 1 while the spell is active.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>",
