      "raw": "<p>You fill the target's mind with terrifying images to disrupt their combat focus. The target must attempt a Will save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes a –1 circumstance penalty to attack and damage rolls against you.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Spell Effect: Debilitating Terror]</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target can't use hostile actions against you.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 1} and can't use hostile actions against you.</p>",
