      "raw": "<p>You invite a spirit you've bonded with to bolster your mind. You gain a +1 status bonus to an Intelligence-, Wisdom-, or Charisma-based skill of your choice. Additionally, you gain a +1 status bonus to saving throws against curse, death, emotion, and fear effects.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The status bonus to the skill and your saving throws increases to +2.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> The status bonus to the skill and your saving throws increases to +3.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Spell Effect: Entreat Spirit]</p>",
