      "raw": "<p>A long, jagged needle jabs into the target foe's psyche whenever it tries to attack a creature your patron holds in special regard. Name yourself or one of your allies. The target takes 2 mental damage any time it uses a hostile action against the named creature, with a basic Will save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> Increase the damage by 2.</p>",
