      "raw": "<p>You temporarily enhance a weapon, replacing it with finer materials. On the next successful attack with that weapon during the spell's duration, the attack deals an additional 1d6 precision damage. You can choose for the metal to become your choice of cold iron, silver, or steel, causing the attack to bypass resistances accordingly.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Spell Effect: Precious Gleam]</p>",
