      "raw": "<p>You spin your staff with a twirling flourish, attacking two foes and transforming the momentum into magical energy to charge for your next @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Spellstrike]. Make a melee Strike with your staff against one foe and then a second melee Strike with your staff against a different foe. Your multiple attack penalty applies to both of these attacks as normal.</p>",
