      "raw": "<p>You create a churning eddy of warm air that makes it difficult to fly within the area. This area is difficult terrain for flying creatures. Each time a flying creature enters the area or ends its turn there, it must attempt an Acrobatics check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Maneuver in Flight].</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature descends 30 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature descends 60 feet.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The duration increases to 10 minutes.</p>",
