      "raw": "<p>Webbing grows between your fingers and your nails extend into vicious claws. For the spell's duration, you gain a +1 status bonus to Athletics checks to Swim and you gain a claws unarmed attack. They're an agile, finesse, unarmed attack that deals 1d4 slashing damage and an additional 1d6 cold damage.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Spell Effect: Claws of the Otter]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+3)</strong> The additional cold damage increases by 1d6.</p>",
