    "description": {
      "raw": "<p>You attune yourself to an underlying cosmic order to the world. While you remain in tune with this power, you gain a +1 status bonus to Perception checks, saving throws, and skill checks. If you critically fail any check while under the effects of this spell, the bonus ends and you instead have a -1 status penalty to all checks for the remaining duration.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Spell Effect: Impeccable Flow]</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The status bonus increases to +2.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> The status bonus increases to +3.</p><hr /><p><em>Note: The automation for the critical failure effect defaults to 10 rounds and must be altered manually.</em></p>",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "kind": "TEXT",
          "value": "You attune yourself to an underlying cosmic order to the world. While you remain in tune with this power, you gain a +1 status bonus to Perception checks, saving throws, and skill checks. If you critically fail any check while under the effects of this spell, the bonus ends and you instead have a -1 status penalty to all checks for the remaining duration."
        },
        {
          "kind": "UUID",
          "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.Spell Effect: Impeccable Flow"
        },
        {
          "kind": "TEXT",
          "value": "---\nHeightened (5th) The status bonus increases to +2.\n\nHeightened (8th) The status bonus increases to +3.\n\n---\nNote: The automation for the critical failure effect defaults to 10 rounds and must be altered manually."
        }
      ]
    },
