    "target": "1 willing creature",
    "area": null,
    "duration": {
      "value": "1 minute",
      "sustained": false
    },
    "defense": null,
    "damage": {},
    "heightening": null,
    "overlays": [],
    "counteraction": false,
    "ritual": null,
    "rules": [],
    "description": {
      "raw": "<p>The target leaves behind a trail of shifting rubble that typically consists of stones, but you could choose another earthen material, such as loose sand or soil. For 2 rounds, when the target willingly moves out of a space, and if the target is in contact with the ground, the ground in that space becomes difficult terrain. The difficult terrain remains for the spell's duration.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The target leaves difficult terrain behind for 1 minute instead of two rounds, and the spell's duration is 10 minutes.</p>",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "kind": "TEXT",
          "value": "The target leaves behind a trail of shifting rubble that typically consists of stones, but you could choose another earthen material, such as loose sand or soil. For 2 rounds, when the target willingly moves out of a space, and if the target is in contact with the ground, the ground in that space becomes difficult terrain. The difficult terrain remains for the spell's duration.\n\n---\n\nHeightened (4th) The target leaves difficult terrain behind for 1 minute instead of two rounds, and the spell's duration is 10 minutes."
        }
      ]
    },
    "dependencyIds": []
