    "overlays": [],
    "counteraction": false,
    "ritual": null,
    "rules": [],
    "description": {
      "raw": "<p>You completely surround a Large or smaller creature in immobile illusory walls, trapping it inside a false prison it can't escape. No other creatures see or feel these walls, and the target can't see anything outside of the illusory walls. The target can attempt a Will save when the spell is cast, each time it attempts to interact with or escape the walls, and each time something from outside the walls affects the target. On a success, it disbelieves the illusion and the spell ends.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> You can target up to 5 creatures.</p>",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "kind": "TEXT",
          "value": "You completely surround a Large or smaller creature in immobile illusory walls, trapping it inside a false prison it can't escape. No other creatures see or feel these walls, and the target can't see anything outside of the illusory walls. The target can attempt a Will save when the spell is cast, each time it attempts to interact with or escape the walls, and each time something from outside the walls affects the target. On a success, it disbelieves the illusion and the spell ends.\n\n---\n\nHeightened (8th) You can target up to 5 creatures."
        }
      ]
    },
