    "description": {
      "raw": "<p>You maintain a brisk performance that keeps allies on the move. You and your allies in the area can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Hustle] for the spell's duration, in addition to your other exploration activities (your exploration activity is Sustaining this spell). You and your allies then become temporarily immune for 1 day.</p>\n<p>If you enter an encounter while performing this song, you can use your Performance modifier for the initiative roll. You and your affected allies also receive a +1 status bonus to that initiative roll.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can Sustain the Spell for up to 2 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> You can Sustain the Spell for up to 4 hours.</p>",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "kind": "TEXT",
          "value": "You maintain a brisk performance that keeps allies on the move. You and your allies in the area can"
        },
        {
          "kind": "UUID",
          "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Hustle"
        },
        {
          "kind": "TEXT",
          "value": "for the spell's duration, in addition to your other exploration activities (your exploration activity is Sustaining this spell). You and your allies then become temporarily immune for 1 day.\n\nIf you enter an encounter while performing this song, you can use your Performance modifier for the initiative roll. You and your affected allies also receive a +1 status bonus to that initiative roll.\n\n---\n\nHeightened (6th) You can Sustain the Spell for up to 2 hours.\n\nHeightened (9th) You can Sustain the Spell for up to 4 hours."
        }
      ]
    },
