      "raw": "<p>You appear larger and stronger to nearby creatures, appearing to possess threatening features like antlers, claws, or poison to their senses. Each non-allied creature in the area must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1}. This condition doesn't decrease at the end of its turn if it damaged you during that turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As success, but @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 3}.</p>",
