      "raw": "<p>You adopt the stance of clinging shadows. You can make shadow grasp Strikes. These deal 1d4 void damage; are in the brawling group; and have the agile, grapple, reach, and unarmed traits. While in clinging shadows stance, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Athletics checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Grapple], and to the DC for creatures to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Escape] from you.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Stance: Clinging Shadows Stance]</p>",
