          "kind": "TEXT",
          "value": ". The target isn't affected by the chosen condition, and if you suppress the Grabbed or Restrained condition, the target automatically breaks free from the grab or restraint when you Cast the Spell.\n\nIf you don't remove the effect that provided the condition, the condition returns after the spell ends. For example, if a spell was making the target Confused for 1 minute, word of freedom would let the target act normally for a round, but the Confused condition would return afterward."
