          "value": "additionally takes a -1 circumstance penalty to the attack roll or skill you boasted about for 1 minute. If at least one creature becomes frightened, you gain a +1 status penalty to the attack roll or skill you boasted about for 1 minute.\n\n---\n\nHeightened (8th) The bonus and penalty increase to 2."
