      "raw": "<p>You spray a colorful, caustic foam into the target's eyes, which clings to their face. Make a spell attack roll. If you hit, you deal 5d10 acid damage and 1d6 persistent acid damage, and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Blinded] for the duration. The foam can be removed with 3 Interact actions, which ends the persistent acid damage. These Interact actions don't need to be consecutive. When the target's persistent acid damage ends, the spell automatically ends.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> The initial damage increases to 9d10, and the persistent acid damage increases to 2d6.</p>",
