        {
          "kind": "UUID",
          "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Lock"
        },
        {
          "kind": "TEXT",
          "value": ", or against a spell or effect that deals damage or delivers secondary effects when it's opened, such as"
        },
        {
          "kind": "UUID",
          "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Rune Trap"
        },
        {
          "kind": "TEXT",
          "value": ". If you succeed, you recover its energy, restoring one of your expended spell slots of 3rd rank or lower.\n\n---\n\nHeightened (8th) You can restore an expended spell slot of 4th rank or lower.\n\nHeightened (9th) You can restore an expended spell slot of 5th rank or lower.\n\nHeightened (10th) You can restore an expended spell slot of 6th rank or lower."
        }
