          "kind": "TEXT",
          "value": "when casting any primal spell or the spell fails. Furthermore, animal, fungus, and plant creatures become hostile to it, even one with a strong bond to the target, such as an animal companion.\n\nThe GM might decide that you can't subject some creatures, such as an emissary of a nature deity, to the ire of nature."
