      "raw": "<p>You create a seven-layered sphere to protect an area. This multicolored sphere functions like a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Prismatic Wall] but is shaped in a 10-foot burst centered on a corner of your space. You must form the sphere in an unbroken open space so its edges don't pass through any creatures or objects, or the spell is lost.</p>",
