      "raw": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are prone and your Speed is at least 10 feet.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You move 5 feet by crawling and continue to stay @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone].</p>",
