      "raw": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Silence]</p>\n<p>You make no sound, preventing creatures from noticing you using hearing alone.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell creates an aura in a 10-foot emanation around you, silencing all sound in or passing through it. While within the aura, creatures are subject to the same effects as the target.</p>",
