      "raw": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Organsight]</p>\n<p>You gain a +2 circumstance bonus on Medicine checks against the target that depend on its organs, but a -2 circumstance penalty on Medicine checks depending on seeing its skin.</p>\n<p>If you succeed the Recall Knowledge check, the next time you deal piercing or slashing damage to the target with a Strike or spell, you deal additional precision damage.</p>",
